# Synthetic MoE prototype: FFN-only experts, PSRAM -> SRAM per-layer refill
# Board: ESP32-S3-CAM, 8 MB octal PSRAM, 16 MB flash, SD 40 MHz 1-bit
# Backbone: /sdcard/models/default.m8 (stories260k-q8, crc 0xb2f5d2bd)
# Sidecar: /sdcard/models/moe.bin, 355,776 B, sha256 55405dd3fbaf1ce7
#   expert 0 = FFN of default.m8 (A), expert 1 = FFN of alt.m8 (B, synthetic
#   scale=1.03), router = synthetic N(0, 0.05), seed 2026
# Build: MOE_TEST=1. Provisioned from the flash model partition, then booted
# A normally. The sidecar was read from SD, then the card was unmounted.
#
# Two full runs on the same build; CRCs, route counts and copy counts are
# identical. Timings vary by <0.1%.

MOE_PROV rc=0 bytes=355776 experts=2 path=/sdcard/models/moe.bin
