I (2429) llm: int8 weights placed: 260608 B internal SRAM, 0 B PSRAM (slab no)
I (2452) model: sanity ok: top32 crc=0xb2f5d2bd greedy=432,383,286,...
I (2453) llms3: model source: .m8 blob
